  <p>Here is the portfolio of a Multimedia Generalist and multi-disciplinary designer specializing in 3D modeling, character design, jewelry design, branding and UI collaboration. It collects selected <a href="#work">work</a>, <a href="#experience">experience</a>, <a href="#education">education</a> and <a href="#skills">skills</a>.</p>
