  <div class="view" id="v-disc" hidden>
  <h1>Discussion: Pukar Wanem Limbu</h1>
  <div class="crumb">&lt; <a href="#top">Portfolio</a></div>
  <p>Leave a review or start a thread about the work. No account is needed, the name field is optional, and replies can be nested.</p>
  <div id="davg" class="mut"></div>
